sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Cliente
  participant API as services/api (Go)
  participant PG as PostgreSQL 16

  C->>API: GET /api/v1/export/{task_id}?formato=no_tecnico (Bearer JWT)
  API->>PG: SELECT 1 FROM result_item WHERE task_id = $1 LIMIT 1
  PG-->>API: Existe
  API-->>C: HTTP 200 (Content-Type: text/csv, Content-Disposition: attachment)
  API->>PG: Cursor streaming SELECT data FROM result_item WHERE task_id = $1 ORDER BY id ASC
  loop Por cada fila (buffer 64 KB, memoria O(1))
    PG-->>API: fila JSONB
    API->>API: Filtra clases problemáticas y confianza >= 80%
    API->>API: Etiqueta confianza (muy probable / probable / quizás con error)
    API-->>C: Flush fragmento CSV
  end
